          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Tat Sat - The Ultimate Truth</strong><br/>Tat Sat isn’t just a brand, it is a mantra, a mission, and a memory of your soul’s original light. Rooted in the divine phrase \"Hari Om Tat Sat\" from the ancient Vedas, Tat Sat combines the sacred principles of preservation, transformation, and elevation through energy.<br/><br/> <strong>We are the keepers of Trinity Healing:</strong><br/>•<strong> Light</strong> – Through Light Codes we awaken the subtle blueprints of your soul<br/>• <strong>Sound</strong> – Through Sound Frequency Healing we tune in the vibration of your inner and outer world<br/>• <strong>Fire</strong> – Through Sacred Fire Rituals we invoke transformation and energetic release<br/><br/> <strong>The Deeper Symbolism</strong><br/>• Tat – The eternal principle, associated with Lord Vishnu, the Preserver. He is the source of Light and Balance in the universe. His four arms signify the four directions and his reach across creation. Vishnu carries the radiance of wisdom and the light of purpose.<br/>• Sat – The absolute truth, connected with Lord Shiva, the Transformer. He embodies both Fire (the energy that purifies and destroys illusion) and Sound (the vibration of Om, the cosmic truth). Shiva liberates the soul from karmic cycles.<br/><br/> <strong>Together, Tat Sat means:</strong><br/>• Tat (Tat)- All that exists beyond perception<br/>• Sat (Truth)- All that is real, eternal, and unchanging. We believe that the creator and the  creation are one. What you see and what lies beyond it are both divine.</p>",
