        "text_CmY6Rz": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Our Philosophy:</strong><br/>At Tat Sat, every product we serve, is not just a piece of crystal. it is: <br/>• Infused with Trinity Healing: Light, Sound, and Fire<br/>Our offerings help realign your energetic blueprint with the ancient forces of the universe. They are designed not just to heal, but to burn karmas, preserve dharma, and awaken the light within.<br/>We don’t just offer energy tools, we offer energy contracts which your soul already chose before entering this lifetime.</p><p><strong> Mantra of the Soul: Hari Om Tat Sat</strong><br/>This sacred mantra represents:<br/>• Hari (The manifest) -  the world, the life, the visible<br/>• Om (The unmanifest) - the source, the void, the unknown<br/>• Tat Sat - That which is the only eternal truth.</p><p> Hari Om Tat Sat is not just a chant. It is a bridge. From your mind to your higher self. From noise to stillness. From confusion to clarity.</p><p> <strong>According to the Bhagavad Gita:</strong><br/>• Om - The divine beginning of all spiritual practices<br/>• Tat - Surrender of the ego and attachment to results<br/>• Sat - All that is done in truth, sincerity, and divine alignment</p><p>This mantra reminds us that we are not separate from the divine, we are truth in motion, energy in evolution, and light in a human form.</p>",
